" Set listchars for `set list` mode.
set listchars=eol:¬,tab:>·,trail:~,extends:>,precedes:<,space:␣

" Proper syntax highlighting for a Jenkinsfile.
au BufNewFile,BufRead Jenkinsfile setf groovy

